@Telemetry.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5152

### Enroll a device
POST {{Telemetry.Server_HostAddress}}/api/v1/devices/enroll
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceName": "demo-endpoint",
  "machineGuid": "replace-with-a-unique-machine-guid",
  "osVersion": "Windows 11",
  "agentVersion": "1.0.0"
}

### Upload a telemetry batch (replace these values with the enrollment response)
POST {{Telemetry.Server_HostAddress}}/api/v1/telemetry/batch
X-Device-Id: {{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}",
  "droppedSamplesCount": 0,
  "samples": [
    {
      "sampleId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
      "capturedAtUtc": "2026-10-30T08:30:00Z",
      "cpuPercent": 12.5,
      "memoryUsedMb": 4096,
      "sessionState": "Active",
      "idleSeconds": 12,
      "foregroundProcess": "notepad.exe",
      "foregroundAppName": "Notepad",
      "agentVersion": "1.0.0",
      "sequenceNumber": 1,
      "agentStartedAtUtc": "2026-10-30T08:00:00Z",
      "queueDepth": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Get dashboard data
GET {{Telemetry.Server_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dashboard/overview?range=1h
Accept: application/json

### Get dashboard data for a selected device and time window
GET {{Telemetry.Server_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dashboard/overview?deviceId={{deviceId}}&range=24h
Accept: application/json

### Check server health
GET {{Telemetry.Server_HostAddress}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### Example rejected batch request (missing credentials)
POST {{Telemetry.Server_HostAddress}}/api/v1/telemetry/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{"deviceId":"{{deviceId}}","droppedSamplesCount":0,"samples":[]}

###
